This folder contains commands which establish invairants for the world state.

Note: After working with the primitives some more, it has become clear to me that I don't
need to establish invariants in this way. I can just script the invariant from the primitives
and define it that way. It will establish the validity through the script.

Example:
invariant <participant> <type> [key1,key2...keyN] [arg1,arg2..argN] [prediction1...predictionN]


Checks if book has a key named name.
```text
    invariant book hasKey [] ["name"] []
```

Check if book["name"] has a minimum length of 1.
```text
    invariant book minLength ["name"] [1] []
```

Checks if book_name has a minimum length of 1.
```text
    invariant book_name minLength [] [1] []
```

                